e and Michele produced one child, Emily. The subject of This Is Your Life (1955) on two separate occasions, the actor survived two major ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.imdb.com/search/name/?birth_year=1930\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d15\"},\"ref\":\"d15\",\"snippet\":\" ... decade before its time, prefiguring shows like The Office and Arrested Development with its lack of a laugh track, a single camera setup, and a roster of unlikable characters. It blurred the line between reality and TV show, with real-life actors playing themselves on the talk show ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.pastemagazine.com/tv/the-100-best-tv-sitcoms-of-all-time\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d16\"},\"ref\":\"d16\",\"snippet\":\" ... Dern appeared as real-life rancher George Spahn in Quentin Tarantino's 10-time Academy Award nominated \\\"Once Upon a Time in Hollywood.\\\" The film also won the Golden Globes & Critics Choice Awards for Best Picture, among others. He also co-starred in the #1 independent film of ... \",\"title\":\"https://m.imdb.com/search/name/?birth_year=1936&ref_=nmbio_bth_yr\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d17\"},\"ref\":\"d17\",\"snippet\":\" ... character Dr. Mark Sloan first in an episode of Jake and the Fatman, then in a series of TV movies on CBS that became the foundation for his popular television drama Diagnosis: Murder. The series ran from 1993 to 2001 with son Barry Van Dyke co-starring in ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dick_Van_Dyke\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"70456c23fd608727d28ad506906e13dfdd7a123544f547e804cfa2e7d77f53a0\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"da4dcc3b81dc385da9de81879fc4569b8d7239cd1b4c009dee3b83b00bc46cee\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measured\"},\"query\":\"TV series character married multiple times only one child survives real life relative co-star\",\"view\":\"full\"},{\"cached\":false,\"hits\":[{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d18\"},\"ref\":\"d18\",\"snippet\":\" ... on Friends as fictional Days cast member Jessica Ashley (instead of her real-life series character, Sami Brady), Kristian Alfonso as Hope Brady, and Roark Critchlow as Mike Horton. In the Season 9 episode \\\"The One With The Soap Opera Party,\\\" in which Joey hosts a \\\"soap opera ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Days_of_Our_Lives\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d11\"},\"ref\":\"d11\",\"snippet\":\" ... Greif appeared on the science fiction show Blake's 7, which premiered in the late '70s, and more recently portrayed real-life politician Bernard Weatherill on season 4 of The Crown. His many other credits included the soap operas Coronation Street and Eastenders, the sitcom Citizen Smith, and ... \",\"title\":\"https://ew.com/celebrity/stars-we-lost-in-2022/?srsltid=AfmBOoqgtseDJPvB8Bamfe3oZlhWJZaiC5kf4fxP0pjffkBximQEpPNy\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d19\"},\"ref\":\"d19\",\"snippet\":\" ... Lucci was expected to guest star on Prospect Park's continuation of All My Children in 2013, but the appearance never came to fruition due to the show's second cancellation.\\n\\nErica is considered to be the most popular character in American soap opera history. TV Guide calls ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Erica_Kane\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d20\"},\"ref\":\"d20\",\"snippet\":\" ... Havoc appeared occasionally on such successful television series as The Untouchables; Murder, She Wrote; McMillan & Wife; The Paper Chase; and The Outer Limits, as well as an arc on the popular soap opera General Hospital.\\n\\nPersonal life\\n\\nHavoc was married three times. Her first marriage, at age 16 ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/June_Havoc\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d21\"},\"ref\":\"d21\",\"snippet\":\" ... Daytime Emmy Award nominated portrayal of Jana Hawkes on The Young and the Restless, was photographed on set with fellow cast members. The casting and character was officially announced on May 27, 2020. O'Brien stated to Soap Opera Digest \\\"It was for the best because this role ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Days_of_Our_Lives_characters_introduced_in_the_2020s\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d22\"},\"ref\":\"d22\",\"snippet\":\" ... In 1983, she divorced Motes, citing \\\"cruelty\\\"; she later said that marrying him was the biggest mistake of her life.\\n\\nCareer\\n\\nHe made his acting debut in 1974, appearing on the soap opera How to Survive a Marriage. He also appeared on the NBC daytime soap opera Another ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Eric_Roberts\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d23\"},\"ref\":\"d23\",\"snippet\":\" ... The key character of Mike Karr on The Edge of Night was played by three actors.\\n\\nConversely, several actors have remained playing the same character for many years, or decades even. Helen Wagner played Hughes family matriarch Nancy Hughes on American soap As the World Turns from its ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Soap_opera\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d24\"},\"ref\":\"d24\",\"snippet\":\" ... William Devane, who played Greg Sumner, re-wrote most of his character's dialogue, to the point where, in co-star Michele Lee's words, \\\"most people (on set) were (probably) frightened of him\\\". The Gary/Val/Abby triangle that provided story throughout the mid-1980s was suggested ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Knots_Landing\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d25\"},\"ref\":\"d25\",\"snippet\":\" ... See also\\n\\n* List of longest-serving soap opera actors\\n* List of One Life to Live characters\\n* List of One Life to Live cast members\\n\\nReferences\\n\\nExternal links\\n\\n* \\n* One Life to Live: Soaps.com\\n* \\n* Soap Opera scripts, 1975-1989 Billy Rose Theatre Division, The New York Public Library.\\n\\nCategory ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/One_Life_to_Live\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d26\"},\"ref\":\"d26\",\"snippet\":\" ... Stars & Their Real-Life Romances\\n\\nAmanda Edwards / Getty Images / Rodin Eckenroth\\n\\nThe Young and the Restless remains the most-watched daytime soap opera on the air. Since 1983, Y&R has let viewers inside the lives of the captivating characters in Genoa City.\\n\\nMany of the soap's ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.swooon.com/gallery/young-and-the-restless-stars-real-life-relationships-couples-dating-history/\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"d33f4e9463624db3d24cf56dbc69c0dc195bd9ce98c3873fa52576856da4d8e1\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"ba53144c10d4e5ad6437d79db0bdc872451b8ac45beeb6d584b644507278a269\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measured\"},\"query\":\"soap opera character three marriages one surviving child actor real life family member co-star\",\"view\":\"full\"}]}","role":"tool","tool_call_id":"call_5355f8e744804d859dcc3e3c"},{"content":"{\"action_slot_charged\":true,\"executed\":true,\"ok\":true,\"results\":[{\"cached\":false,\"hits\":[{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d27\"},\"ref\":\"d27\",\"snippet\":\" ... The adaptation changes a character's ethnicity.\\n\\n- Real-Life Relative: Related characters are played by actors who actually are related in real life.\\n\\n- Real Life Writes the Hairstyle: A character's hairstyle is affected by real-life circumstances.\\n\\n- Real-Person Cameo: A work with a character based on ... \",\"title\":\"https://tvtropes.org/pmwiki/pmwiki.php/Main/CharactersAndCasting\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d28\"},\"ref\":\"d28\",\"snippet\":\" ... Some cast members' real-life partners appeared on the show.\\n\\nPoehler's then-husband Will Arnett appeared on season two, episode 13 (\\\"The Set-Up\\\"), playing an eccentric MRI technician who goes on a blind date with Leslie. The ex-couple had previously acted together on Arnett's ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.businessinsider.com/things-fun-facts-you-didnt-know-about-parks-and-recreation\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d29\"},\"ref\":\"d29\",\"snippet\":\" ... But people working together can create familial bonds; actors may like one another and the characters they play. They may want to play that music one more time, and perhaps another time, like Mick and Keith at 80, or Oasis in their 50s. Ultimately, there is no \\\"should ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.latimes.com/entertainment-arts/tv/story/2024-09-05/television-series-art-length-time\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d30\"},\"ref\":\"d30\",\"snippet\":\" ... year-old actor in New York who has trouble deciding on the mundanities of day-to-day existence, as well as on life's bigger challenges. Amusing and cinematic while exploring various everyday themes, the series is simultaneously broad in scope and intensely personal. With oodles of heart ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.indiewire.com/feature/best-tv-shows-decade-2010-2019-netflix-hbo-1202148573/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d31\"},\"ref\":\"d31\",\"snippet\":\" ... line of \\\"Marcia, Marcia, Marcia!\\\" is one of the most famous lines from what classic TV series?\\n\\nAnswer: The Brady Bunch - What man with a quirky delivery, who later played the mayor on \\\"Family Guy\\\", portrayed Batman on the relatively silly TV show that aired from 1966-1968 ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.watercoolertrivia.com/trivia-questions/classic-tv-trivia-questions\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d17\"},\"ref\":\"d17\",\"snippet\":\" ... star as the character Dr. Mark Sloan first in an episode of Jake and the Fatman, then in a series of TV movies on CBS that became the foundation for his popular television drama Diagnosis: Murder. The series ran from 1993 to 2001 with son Barry Van Dyke ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dick_Van_Dyke\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d32\"},\"ref\":\"d32\",\"snippet\":\" ... Actors who are siblings in real life are commonly cast to play siblings on television. After all, that's the best way to make it seem like the relationship is an authentic one. In the case of Jessica and Richard Harmon, though, the siblings actually play unrelated characters ... \",\"title\":\"https://screenrant.com/cw-stars-family/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d33\"},\"ref\":\"d33\",\"snippet\":\" ... profile return to broadcast for the actor best known as McDreamy on Grey's Anatomy. Although, it must be said, this does not sound very McDreamy at all.\\n\\n\\\"Memory of a Killer is a propulsive series with a noisy, unrelenting character hook that immediately grabbed our attention,\\\" said ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.imdb.com/title/tt3758542/news/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d34\"},\"ref\":\"d34\",\"snippet\":\" ... Not to be confused with Real-Life Relative, which is when the actors actually are related, either by blood or marriage, not necessarily playing relatives, and don't even have to look alike (as family members often don't).\\n\\nExamples:\\n\\n- In the Kia commercials with Blake Griffin time ... \",\"title\":\"https://tvtropes.org/pmwiki/pmwiki.php/Main/SeparatedAtBirthCasting\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_